OL,3,GNEWSA'Lessons need to be learnt' as
OL,4,Areport into care homes during Covid
OL,5,Apublished
OL,6,
OL,7,FLessons need to be learnt after an
OL,8,Finquiry found that government failings
OL,9,Fin care settings allowed the spread of
OL,10,FCovid, a woman whose mother died during
OL,11,Fthe pandemic has said.
OL,13,FThe sixth report from the Covid
OL,14,Finquiry, which was published on
OL,15,FTuesday, said the care sector appeared
OL,16,Fto be "something of an afterthought" in
OL,17,Fthe early stages of the pandemic and
OL,18,Fthere was no "protective ring" put
OL,19,Faround homes as claimed by ministers at
OL,20,Fthe time.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
