OL,3,GNEWSA'Lessons need to be learnt' as
OL,4,Areport into care homes during Covid
OL,5,Apublished
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were more than 43,000 recorded
OL,8,Fdeaths involving Covid in care homes
OL,9,Fbetween March 2020 and July 2022.
OL,11,FMartina Ferguson, whose mother Ursula
OL,12,FDerry died during the coronavirus
OL,13,Fpandemic, said "we need to learn from
OL,14,Fwhat's happened".
